{"seq":1,"slug":"speech-recognition","title":"语音识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/natural-language-processing/speech-processing/speech-recognition","wordCount":1728,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"语音识别\">语音识别</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语音识别（Automatic Speech Recognition，ASR）将语音信号转换为文字文本，是语音交互的第一步，也是人机对话、会议记录、字幕生成等应用的技术基础。语音识别的挑战在于语音信号的高维性和多变性——同一句话由不同人、在不同环境下说出，声学特征差异巨大。从 GMM-HMM 的统计时代到 CTC 和 Attention 的深度学习时代，再到 Whisper 的大规模弱监督预训练与多模态语音大模型，语音识别技术经历了根本性的范式转变。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[语音信号] --&gt; B[特征提取]&#10;    B --&gt; C[声学模型]&#10;    C --&gt; D[解码器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[文字输出]&#10;    subgraph 传统流水线&#10;        B --&gt; B1[MFCC/FBank]&#10;        C --&gt; C1[GMM-HMM]&#10;        D --&gt; D1[WFST解码]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[语音信号] --&gt; B[特征提取]\n    B --&gt; C[声学模型]\n    C --&gt; D[解码器]\n    D --&gt; E[文字输出]\n    subgraph 传统流水线\n        B --&gt; B1[MFCC/FBank]\n        C --&gt; C1[GMM-HMM]\n        D --&gt; D1[WFST解码]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ASR 范式</th>\n<th>声学模型</th>\n<th>语言模型</th>\n<th>解码</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GMM-HMM</td>\n<td>高斯混合模型</td>\n<td>N-gram</td>\n<td>WFST</td>\n<td>Kaldi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNN-HMM</td>\n<td>DNN 替代 GMM</td>\n<td>N-gram</td>\n<td>WFST</td>\n<td>Kaldi-DNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTC</td>\n<td>LSTM/Conformer</td>\n<td>外部 LM</td>\n<td>前缀搜索</td>\n<td>DeepSpeech</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attention</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>内部/外部 LM</td>\n<td>束搜索</td>\n<td>ESPnet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>Conformer + CTC + Att</td>\n<td>联合解码</td>\n<td>联合束搜索</td>\n<td>WeNet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模预训练</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>贪心/束搜索</td>\n<td>Whisper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多模态语音 LLM</td>\n<td>音频编码器 + LLM</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>自回归生成</td>\n<td>GPT-4o/Qwen-Omni</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>语音识别系统的性能用词错误率（Word Error Rate，WER）衡量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WER = \\frac{S + D + I}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 分别是替换、删除和插入错误数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是参考文本的总词数。中文语音识别通常使用字错误率（Character Error Rate，CER）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声学特征与前端处理\">声学特征与前端处理</h2><p>语音信号是一维的时域波形，采样率通常为 16kHz（每秒 16000 个采样点）。直接用原始波形作为模型输入维度过高且包含大量冗余信息，需要先提取声学特征。</p>\n<p>梅尔频率倒谱系数（MFCC）是最经典的声学特征。提取流程包括：预加重（高频增强）、分帧（通常 25ms 帧长、10ms 帧移）、加窗（汉明窗）、FFT、梅尔滤波器组、对数能量和离散余弦变换。MFCC 保留了语音中与语音内容相关的频谱包络信息，去除了与说话人相关的精细结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def compute_mel_spectrogram(&#10;    waveform: np.ndarray,&#10;    sample_rate: int = 16000,&#10;    n_fft: int = 400,&#10;    hop_length: int = 160,&#10;    n_mels: int = 80&#10;) -&gt; np.ndarray:&#10;    frames = np.lib.stride_tricks.sliding_window_view(waveform, n_fft)[::hop_length]&#10;    window = np.hanning(n_fft)&#10;    spectrum = np.abs(np.fft.rfft(frames * window, n=n_fft))&#10;    mel_basis = _mel_filterbank(sample_rate, n_fft, n_mels)&#10;    mel_spec = np.dot(spectrum ** 2, mel_basis.T)&#10;    return np.log(np.maximum(mel_spec, 1e-10))&#10;&#10;def _mel_filterbank(sr: int, n_fft: int, n_mels: int) -&gt; np.ndarray:&#10;    low_freq = 0&#10;    high_freq = sr / 2&#10;    mel_low = 2595 * np.log10(1 + low_freq / 700)&#10;    mel_high = 2595 * np.log10(1 + high_freq / 700)&#10;    mel_points = np.linspace(mel_low, mel_high, n_mels + 2)&#10;    hz_points = 700 * (10 ** (mel_points / 2595) - 1)&#10;    bins = np.floor((n_fft + 1) * hz_points / sr).astype(int)&#10;    fbank = np.zeros((n_mels, n_fft // 2 + 1))&#10;    for i in range(n_mels):&#10;        fbank[i, bins[i]:bins[i+1]] = np.linspace(0, 1, bins[i+1] - bins[i])&#10;        fbank[i, bins[i+1]:bins[i+2]] = np.linspace(1, 0, bins[i+2] - bins[i+1])&#10;    return fbank\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_mel_spectrogram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    waveform: np.ndarray,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sample_rate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_fft: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hop_length: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_mels: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> np.ndarray:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    frames </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.lib.stride_tricks.sliding_window_view(waveform, n_fft)[::hop_length]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.hanning(n_fft)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    spectrum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.abs(np.fft.rfft(frames </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_fft))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mel_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _mel_filterbank(sample_rate, n_fft, n_mels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mel_spec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.dot(spectrum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, mel_basis.T)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E